  <ThingDef ParentName="RM_TheRotPortedCavePlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Vellugra</defName>
    <label>vellugra</label>
    <description>A many-capped mushroom that seems to be melting where it stands: blue-veined pink caps stacked up a knotted stalk, every rim sagging into long, slow drips of slime that never quite fall. The slime is thick and bitter, not the sweetsnare's lure; it seals the cap against the Rot's endless moulds, and a pawn who brushes one carries the smell for a day. Scraped clean, the flesh is good raw fungus.</description>
    <descriptionHyperlinks>
      <ThingDef>RawFungus</ThingDef>
    </descriptionHyperlinks>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>250</MaxHitPoints>
      <Beauty>4</Beauty>
